OL,3,GNEWSACouncil celebrates 10 years of
OL,4,Alink road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has celebrated the 10th
OL,7,Fanniversary of #16m link road in
OL,8,FWorcestershire.
OL,10,FThe Hoobrook Link Road, which connects
OL,11,Fthe A451 Stourport Road and the A442
OL,12,FWorcester Road, opened on 19 September
OL,13,F2016 in Kidderminster to ease
OL,14,Fcongestion and improve journey
OL,15,Freliability.
OL,17,FWorcestershire County Council said that
OL,18,Fover the past decade, the road has
OL,19,Freduced pressure on surrounding roads
OL,20,Fand junctions, while providing wildlife
OL,21,Fcorridors and regenerating a coppice
OL,22,Fwoodland.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
